{
  "notes": "The first-boot World (UI spec cover, 11). D minor, 72 BPM. A warm evolving pad (WARM PAD: its PWM breathes on the LFO) over a deep sine drone that holds a D pedal under moving chords, the player's expressive lead on the Smart Keys (G-FUNK LD: glide, delayed vibrato, long echoes), and sparse 808 percussion: a heartbeat kick and a rain of soft shakers. Scenes: A the pad alone on a two-chord vamp; B the pedal drone enters under a four-chord cycle whose top voice sighs a step down on every beat 3; C the roots move in a 3+3+2 pulse and the pad's top voice sings a rising phrase over a sus4 lift; D strips back to pad and drone in a bigger hall and ends on the tonic. ENERGY adds bass, then percussion, then rain and claps. All material is original.",
  "format": "flowstate-world/1",
  "id": "neon_rain",
  "name": "NEON RAIN",
  "category": "CINEMATIC",
  "blurb": "Rain on neon, slow light",
  "tempo": {"bpm": 72, "min": 64, "max": 80},
